Package: discourse-thpoff
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: disable transparent huge pages before executing a command
 A small wrapper that applies PR_SET_THP_DISABLE and then executes the given
 command. The setting is inherited through fork and exec.
